    "about": {
      "title": "About Canstar Power Tech",
      "subtitle": "15+ Years of Uninterrupted Power Engineering & Heavy Industrial Generation Solutions.",
      "corpOverview": "Can Star Power Tech is an engineering power solutions enterprise authorized as the official distributor of TEKSAN GENERATOR (Turkey) in Bangladesh. We supply, engineer, install, synchronize, and support diesel, gas, and mobile generators from 10 kVA to 3500 kVA.",
      "historyText": "Over 15 years, CAN STAR POWER TECH has commissioned 1200+ generator units across Bangladesh covering top export textile mills, commercial banking headquarters, sports complexes, and healthcare facilities.",
      "missionText": "To provide 99.9% uptime industrial power generation solutions with world-class engineering execution, acoustic sound attenuation, and 24/7 rapid breakdown response."
    },
    "mdMessage": {
      "name": "Hossain Mohammad Kawsar",
      "designation": "Managing Director",
      "quote": "Professionalism is the key word for success to us. Give the customer value for money.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "We are happy to declare that Our valuable clients are the main asset of our company. Our wise clients are the mirror of our company. We respectfully analysis the feedback from our client. ‘Professionalism’ is the key work for success to us. We at “CAN STAR POWER TECH” are determined to play a leading role in the development of POWER SECTOR sector . Over the past eight years we have worked towards building a strong foundation and establishing a professional corporate identity for our company. Today, in the field of alternative power development sector CAN STAR POWER TECH is respected for its achievements, professional ethics and innovative concepts.",
        "Our corporate philosophy is however based on a very simple principle “Give the customer value for money”. To this end, we are constantly working towards upgrading and improving every aspect of our activity.",
        "Today CAN STAR POWER TECH is poised for a new phase of dynamic growth. Our human resource is well trained and motivated; our financial Fundamentals are strong, and we have an excellent goodwill in the market. Our vision is to constantly set challenging goals for ourselves. We will continue to expand and diversify and be an example of a progressive company."
      ],
      "photoUrl": ""
    },
    "ceoMessage": {
      "name": "Nurun Nabi Chowdhury",
      "designation": "CEO - Chief executive officer",
      "quote": "We made commitments towards providing exceptional delivery in an insightful manner to the industry.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "I feel privileged to be writing this message as the Chief Executive Officer. For the entrepreneurs out there, you know how much it takes to get here. I am grateful for all the love, support and understanding we receive constantly; it's with the motivation that our well-wishers provide us that we are at such a great place today.",
        "We made commitments towards providing exceptional delivery in an insightful manner to the industry and along the way, have strengthened our core values towards ensuring quality in everything we do, guidance by example, honesty and simplicity and a focus on an excellent culture that passes on to clients and teams.",
        "Looking ahead, we are focused on accelerating the execution of our expansion strategy while abiding to build on the strength of our brand in helping our clients share knowledge and create innovation, and in bringing positive change to the communities in which we work and live. I am incredibly excited about this journey and truly believe the best is yet to come.",
        "Our group companies have a long and proud history of being responsible employers, operating in a principled and disciplined manner. We are dedicated to attracting, developing and retaining an engaged and diverse workforce who are united in the pursuit of our strategies and goals."
      ],
      "photoUrl": ""
    },
